<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>week</p>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to March 7.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Pioneer International  4.20	9.66</p>
<p> 2   Boral Ltd		  3.806     8.74</p>
<p> 3   Pacific Dunlop	   3.35	8.06</p>
<p> 4   Village Road-Pr	  3.25	7.97</p>
<p> 5   FLC-Paper Div	    2.65	6.00</p>
<p> 6   CSR Ltd		    4.81	5.71</p>
<p> 7   RGC Ltd		    5.40	5.47</p>
<p> 8   Woodside Petroleum     9.16	5.15</p>
<p> 9   PMP Communications     3.40	4.62</p>
<p>10   Goodman Fielder	  1.63	4.49</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1   Crown			2.00     -14.93</p>
<p> 2   Placer Pacific	   1.67	-8.24</p>
<p> 3   FLC-Building Div	 3.54	-6.84</p>
<p> 4   Leighton Holdings	5.24	-6.43</p>
<p> 5   Acacia Resources	 2.08	-6.31</p>
<p> 6   Sydney Harbour Casino  2.225     -5.32</p>
<p> 7   Wesfarmers		 9.85	-5.29</p>
<p> 8   Newcrest Mining	  4.65	-5.10</p>
<p> 9   GIO Australia	    3.45	-4.70</p>
<p>10   Hudson Conway	   14.95	-4.47</p>
<p>	  -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
